step Level 29
  when level<29
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The next guide opens with Korran's The Swarm Grows at the Crossroads, offered from level 29. Short of 29? The Pesterhide Snarlers (28-29) prowl the canyon floor just north-west of Freewind Post: kill them until level 29. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.
  goto 42.4,40.4 map 1441 "Pesterhide Snarlers"
  level 29 grind 4249                 -- grind on Pesterhide Snarler
